      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "is greater risk to yourself."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "For now, it would be best to practice this skill on your own."
