      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "honorably risking our lives"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "to achieve true strength..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Essofeit]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "You..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "You really understand."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "You truly know the value"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "of hardship. It makes me"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
