      "text" : "glad to see that a true"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Knight like you still exists."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Essofeit]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Hahaha, finally, I've"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "found someone I can call"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "a true comrade. We're the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "last of a dying breed if you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "hadn't noticed, my friend. But"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "there is hope for Knights..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 166,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Essofeit]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "It's decided, then."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 168,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "As long as we live,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
