      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "seems like anyone can be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "a Knight. Er, no offense~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 212,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Essofeit]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 213,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "So you've seen the Knights"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 214,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "of the 7th Division for what"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 215,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "they really are, eh? As a fellow Knight, you may understand my"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 216,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "feelings of disappointment."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 218,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Essofeit]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 219,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "It's so disheartening..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 220,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "I don't why we're Knights"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 221,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "or what we're training for."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 222,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "When I was your age, well,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 223,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "I wanted to risk my life and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 224,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "achieve true strength."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 226,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Essofeit]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 227,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "But... I'm sure that you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "don't want to hear an old"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "man's tall tales. All those"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 230,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "wonderful battles, that glorious camaraderie forged between"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 231,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "rivals... It's all in the past."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 234,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Essofeit]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 235,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Maybe it's better that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 236,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "I forget all about my old"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 237,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "fashioned ideals. I guess"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 238,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "times have changed, and that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 239,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "my idea of chivalry may be dead."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 243,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Essofeit]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 244,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Hm, why don't take a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 245,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "tour of the 7th Division"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 246,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "and see the attitude of my"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 247,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "comrades for yourself? You'll"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 248,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "see Grand Master Maroujje"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 249,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "training the recruits outside."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 253,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Essofeit]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 254,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Greetings. I am Essofeit"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 255,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Lageiya of the 7th Division"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 256,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "of the Prontera Chivalry."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 257,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "As a proud Knight upholding"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 258,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "the principles of honor and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 259,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "chivalry, I am at your service."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 261,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Essofeit]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 262,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "May I ask which division"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 263,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "you are from? Ah, you're"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 264,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "a Knight that's been granted"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 265,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "royal permisson to journey"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 266,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "as you please. That must be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 267,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "great, the freedom you have."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 269,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Essofeit]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 270,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Sadly, the Division of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 271,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "which I am member is too"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 272,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "bureaucratic. I believe that my"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 273,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "comrades are more concerned"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 274,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "with their pensions than with chivalry, or defending the weak."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 276,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Essofeit]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 277,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Even if we wanted to be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 278,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "more active, there are too"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 279,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "many regulations that hamper"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 280,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "the good we can do. Over time,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 281,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "the situation has grown much worse. But don't take my word..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 283,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Essofeit]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 284,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Perhaps it will be better"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 285,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "if you visited the 7th Division"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 286,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "for yourself and speak to the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 287,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "other Knights that are training. Hopefully, you will see what"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 288,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "I have seen for a long time..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 293,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Essofeit]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 294,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Greetings. I am Essofeit"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 295,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Lageiya of the 7th Division"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 296,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "of the Prontera Chivalry."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 297,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "As a proud Knight upholding"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 298,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "the principles of honor and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 299,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "chivalry, I am at your service."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 301,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Essofeit]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 302,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "I only wish the others in"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 303,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "my division would appreciate"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 304,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "my values, and the true value"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 305,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "of spilled blood. They may be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 306,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "my comrades, but I find it"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 307,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "difficult to trust them."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 316,
      "text" : "[?]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 317,
      "text" : "Kiiiiiiai~!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 318,
      "text" : "Yaaaaaaaaap!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 319,
      "text" : "Hoo! Haa! Haiyah!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 321,
      "text" : "[?]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 322,
      "text" : "Si-Aiyah!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 323,
      "text" : "Rowr rowr rowr"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 324,
      "text" : "GrrrrrrrraaAAHH!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 326,
      "text" : "^3355FFThese Knights appear to be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 327,
      "text" : "putting themselves through"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 328,
      "text" : "some gruelingly difficult"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 329,
      "text" : "training. But as you listen"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 330,
      "text" : "a little more closely, their"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 331,
      "text" : "screams seem a bit dramatized.^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 335,
      "text" : "^3355FFThis group of Knights"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 336,
      "text" : "appear to be undergoing"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 337,
      "text" : "so pretty grueling training,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 338,
      "text" : "judging from the wailing pitch"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 339,
      "text" : "of their battle screams.^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 344,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "[Grand Master]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 346,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "Alright men, you don't"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 347,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "need to put ^333333that^000000 much effort"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 348,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "into your training. You have"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 349,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "to do this everyday, so make"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 350,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "sure that you don't exhaust"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 351,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "yourselves unnecessarily."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 353,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "[Grand Master]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 354,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "The most important thing"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 355,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "is that you don't injure"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 356,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "yourselves. Take it easy"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 357,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "and make sure that you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 358,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "don't pull a muscle."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 359,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "Um, that's an order!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 363,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "Put your backs into it,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 364,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "men! I know training can"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 365,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "be tough, but it'll make"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 366,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "you harder, better, faster and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 367,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "stronger! Prontera's safety is your responsibility, Knights!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 369,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "[Grand Master]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 370,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 371,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "Oh, I'm just kidding around."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 372,
      "npc" : "Grand Master",
      "text" : "Let's go take a break, guys."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 378,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Zabi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 379,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "I guess we're more like"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 380,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "government employees"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 381,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "than actual Knights. We're"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 382,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "overpaid, and don't really"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 383,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "have to do anything other"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 384,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "than pretend to train."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 386,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Zabi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 387,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Me? I plan on milking"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 388,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "the system for all it's"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 389,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "worth. Work here a few"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 390,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "years, then live the rest"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 391,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "of my life on a fat pension."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 392,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Yeah, that's gonna be great."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 394,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Zabi]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 395,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Whoa-whoa-whoa,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 396,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "the Grand Master's"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 397,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "looking this way! Quit"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 398,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "talkin' to me and let me"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 399,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "grunt like I've got a hernia."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 400,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Hooooo-AH! BWAH! HAI-YAH!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 404,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[A Knight]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 405,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Hooooo-AH!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 406,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "BWAH! HAI-YAH!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 407,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Oh man, I can barely"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 408,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "breathe from all of this"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 409,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "arduous training. Ugh,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 410,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "so incredibly enervated..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 416,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Gon]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 417,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "What'll I get with"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 418,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "my next paycheck?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 419,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Ah~ I should get a nice"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 420,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "necklace for my wife."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 421,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "I just know she'll love it!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 424,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Gon]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 425,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Let's see, how many"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 426,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "more days until payday?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 427,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "One, two... Hmm. For some"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 428,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "reason it never seems to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 429,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "come soon enough, you know?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 432,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[A Knight]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 433,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Maybe I'm not not so good"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 434,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "at fighting or defending the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 435,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "weak, but this Knight position"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 436,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "is a pretty good job. Working"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 437,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "here really lets me save up"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 438,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "cash to invest in my future."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 440,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[A Knight]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 441,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "We may never get to see"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 442,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "any action, but at least"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 443,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "I can take some pride"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 444,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "in being a Knight."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 449,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Jiya]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 451,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Man, this division of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 452,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "the chivalry doesn't seem"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 453,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "to have too much potential."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 454,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Most of us here are pretty"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 455,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "second rate, except maybe"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 456,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "for that one guy, Essofeit."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 459,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Jiya]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 460,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "As for me, I don't have too"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 461,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "much in the way of ambition."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 462,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "As long as I do what I'm told,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 463,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "they'll pay me. And as long"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 464,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "as I get paid, I'm happy."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 467,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "D-don't talk to me!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 468,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Gotta... muster up the..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 469,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Strength to... f-finish all"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 470,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "these... training exercises!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 471,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Alright man, c-concentrate..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 476,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Gatack]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 478,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Wait, where's"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 479,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Essofeit? He can't"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 480,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "just skip daily training,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 481,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "even if he has the distinction"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 482,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "of killing countless ^FF0000Mystcases^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 483,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "and ^FF0000Obeaunes^000000 in his time."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 485,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Gatack]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 486,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Gosh, I'm sick and tired of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 487,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "him talking about Knighthood."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 488,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Essofeit insists that all Knights, even complete rookies, should be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 489,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "able to obtain 5 Candy Canes and 3 Witherless Roses from hunting."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 491,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Gatack]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 492,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Hell, I just hate to hear"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 493,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "his preaching about his great"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 494,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "experiences fighting monsters."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 495,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "But now Essofeit just researches stuff inside the building and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 496,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "doesn't do much else..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 499,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Man, Knight training"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 500,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "is pretty rough. Don't"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 501,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "they know that I'm far"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 502,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "too delicate for all this"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 503,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "strenuous activity?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 505,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "[Gatack]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 506,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "Ah well, if I ever go"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 507,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "down in battle, I won't"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 508,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "be too surprised, seeing"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 509,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "as I'm one of the weakest"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 510,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "guys here. But when it happens,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 511,
      "npc" : "Knight",
      "text" : "I'll be too busy looking good."
    }
  ]
}